urities, keeping the water clear. The low-noise direct water pump ensures stable water flo"]}, "B0CF5B94X2": {"rating": 4.3, "reviews": 1017, "bullets": ["Pet Camera with Treat Tossing: Combination of the dog camera and treat dispenser (0.5L capacity, Recommend 7-15mm food size), you can fill in your fur kid’s favorite treats in the treat dispenser and ", "Unlock the Time Album with Cloud Subscription: AI automatically create a 60-second video of your pet’s best moments from motion-triggered recordings, and saves it for 30 days, Download anytime & One-t", "2K Ultra HD Camera & Night Vision：With 2K Full HD crystal clear pet camera indoor, you could see your furry puppy or cats clearly whenever you want. Our dog camera captures clear and detailed footage ", "Upgraded 360° Viewing Angle：The 355° pan rotation brings a 360° viewing angle, and uses the wide-angle lens to fully know the environment around your pet. This pet camera with phone app supports, moti", "Interactive Two Way Talk: Our dog camera treat dispenser allow for real-time communication. With two-way talk, you can chat with your pet and hear them bark or meow. Express your love to them anytime,"]}}, "clips": {"B0HHRLD7SJ": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/f04f035c-6de4-4bc9-bcb0-bb9d72b03c1f/default.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/39b17062-8fc3-4873-be1b-21907e3f63db/898c9316-9ca4-487d-9ee1-cbcabcb06bfa/071ce33b4ae24899b0cab5bee4ebc66d_0-100-0-100_gandalf_preview.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/f04f035c-6de4-4bc9-bcb0-bb9d72b03c1f/default.jobtemplate.mp4"], "B0F8TTS9K6": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/bffcf942-a494-4cc2-b205-9c0c1f32b3ab/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/8e96cbda-ec3c-4498-9365-20b